# Tasks app seed: the checkout files the wrapper build reads that live
# outside apps/tasks, copied into the seeded package at the canonical package
# layout the tree's zcode-package.json declares (include/, src/ and the
# declared app/ program), so the package prepares and the entrypoint
# (Makefile) compiles the commons ztasks package in place. Keep this list
# equal to the non-apps/tasks lines of `make print-app-closure`: app seed
# refuses a tree whose print-app-closure names a file the tree does not hold.

contexts/commons/packages/ztasks/app/main.c app/main.c
contexts/commons/packages/ztasks/include/ztasks/ztasks.h include/ztasks/ztasks.h
contexts/commons/packages/ztasks/src/ztasks.c src/ztasks.c
